Short Version

MicroGoal is developed using Node.js and Express.js for backend API development, MongoDB and Mongoose for database management, JWT and bcryptjs for authentication and password security, and dotenv for environment configuration. Thunder Client is used to test and validate the REST APIs. The modular architecture improves maintainability, security, and scalability of the application.
